<title>FINLAND: Kone 8-mth profit falls 79 pct.</title>
<headline>Kone 8-mth profit falls 79 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-August-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p>Profit after financial items,</p>
<p> before extraordinary items, tax	  14 vs 66</p>
<p> Loss per share (markka)		  0.32 vs 1.16 profit</p>
<p> Net sales				   6,014 vs 5,721</p>
<p> Operating profit			     83 vs 120</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of analysts' forecasts was a 25 million markka profit after financial items (range 66 million markka loss to 59 million markka profit).</p>
<p> Depreciation				  278 vs 264</p>
<p> Net financial items		 charge 74 vs 68 charge</p>
<p>Share in net income of</p>
<p> associated companies			nil vs 14 gain</p>
<p> Minorities				    nil vs 1 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					    16 vs 58</p>
<p> Net loss					  2 vs 7 profit</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	 34 vs 32</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish lift maker is Kone Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 6805 0245</p>
</text>
